  "markdown": "Direct contact\n\n# Contact Mr Wallcover.\n\nWrite, call or send a message, whichever suits you. Dorin Burcus reads the email and answers the phone himself.\n\n[Start your project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/) Contact Dorin directly\n\n## Ways to reach us\n\n### Email\n\nFor questions, photographs, drawings and specifications. Attachments are welcome.\n\n[info@mrwallcover.com](mailto:info@mrwallcover.com?subject=Wallcovering%20enquiry)\n\n### Phone\n\nDorin Burcus answers the phone himself. Select the button below to see the number.\n\n### WhatsApp\n\nSend a message, with photographs of the walls or the paper label if you have them.\n\n[WhatsApp us](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/)\n\n### A 20-minute call\n\nChoose a time in the calendar to talk the project through.\n\n[Book a call](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ3Aimn0z8hHnmqvg0zrZGV0Zt2PVu8UNOZPnrUJ34DgohlLAwO6xXIPaeH3mr_rE_JeJHr_DzUk)\n\nCalls Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm UK. Each call is 20 minutes.\n\n### Instagram\n\nRecent installations and work in progress.\n\n[@mrwallcover](https://www.instagram.com/mrwallcover/)\n\n## Starting a project?\n\nFor a quotation, the enquiry form asks for the few things that shape the price: the building, the rooms, the material and the timing. Photographs and drawings help, and are optional.\n\n[What to include in your enquiry](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/)\n\n## Where we work\n\nWe work in London and the surrounding areas, and UK-wide on selected projects.\n\n- [Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/mayfair/)\n- [Belgravia](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/belgravia/)\n- [Chelsea](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/chelsea/)\n- [Kensington](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/kensington/)\n- [City of London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/city-of-london/)\n- [Cotswolds](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/cotswolds/)\n- [All areas](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
